OL,4,BFifpro criticises Bayern Munich for    
OL,5,BMusiala comments                       
OL,6,GFootball players' union Fifpro says it 
OL,7,Gis concerned by comments from Bayern   
OL,8,GMunich's hierarchy about Jamal         
OL,9,GMusiala's contract, adding the German  
OL,10,Gclub "should know better".             
OL,12,FMusiala collapsed twice in four days   
OL,13,Fduring pre-season and the 23-year-old  
OL,14,FGermany international said he had been 
OL,15,Fdiagnosed with "easily treatable       
OL,16,Fabsence seizures, which are due to a   
OL,17,Fneurological dysfunction".             
